{"author":{"id":"ad87ffa09351c4e5a412ec8ee1546e86b314f33d6f28629bb4bcfe7b2290924d"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794654678,"nonce":"e73tP00nlflEmsXzL3kdK8eQsqU=","title":"Give the ingest queue a dead-letter queue","message":"The ingest queue has no dead-letter queue: a job that runs out of its 10 retries is gone. And jobs the ingest Worker can't handle are acked rather than retried (api/src/worker/ingest.ts: a language it doesn't know, and the container's 'malformed'), so a DLQ alone wouldn't keep them. Add a dead_letter_queue (Terraform's queue, wrangler.ingest.jsonc consumers) and send those jobs there, or retry them, so they can be looked at and replayed.","files":null}]}